// SparkFun BOB-12009. Seated frame: z = 0 is the header plastic's underside, so the
// board's underside is at z = 2.54 and its top at z = 4.14. The Eagle board is
// 15.24 x 12.7 mm. The low-voltage header is the bottom row and the high-voltage
// header the top row. From lead 1 the low row reads LV4, LV3, GND, LV, LV2, LV1,
// and the high row reads HV1, HV2, HV, GND, HV3, HV4. Each BSS138 has its gate on
// LV, its source on LVn and its drain on HVn.
